From: Local build preparation
Subject: [PATCH] mtd: spi-nor: add support for XMC XM25QH32D

Add support for the XMC XM25QH32D 32-Mbit SPI NOR flash (JEDEC ID
0x204016), with 64 64-KiB sectors and 4-KiB sector erase support.

This patch is intended for the OpenWrt 19.07 Linux 4.14 generic
pending patch series, after the existing XMC XM25QH64A/XM25QH128A
support patch.

---
--- a/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/spi-nor.c
+++ b/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/spi-nor.c
@@ -1205,6 +1205,7 @@ static const struct flash_info spi_nor_ids[] = {
 	/* XMC (Wuhan Xinxin Semiconductor Manufacturing Corp.) */
 	{ "XM25QH64A", INFO(0x207017, 0, 64 * 1024, 128, SECT_4K | SPI_NOR_DUAL_READ | SPI_NOR_QUAD_READ) },
 	{ "XM25QH128A", INFO(0x207018, 0, 64 * 1024, 256, SECT_4K | SPI_NOR_DUAL_READ | SPI_NOR_QUAD_READ) },
+	{ "XM25QH32D", INFO(0x204016, 0, 64 * 1024, 64, SECT_4K) },
 	{ },
 };
